{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2331bdbe4ded5905c0d41d0ce537d4337bcc4f911489f0637149ea1ecd860fcc", "ja": "（今日は屋外で『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n春香の準備はどうかな……）", "zh": "（今天要在户外拍摄《偶像写真！！》。\n春香准备得怎么样了呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "8bcdb9099a9acd1daaae61eae4de192c68ea262578b3a1e8e3f66aec3a7d7e7d", "ja": "{$P$}さんっ！\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "38d09236d2abf69aadbdcfc62dfa8d7c30229169d1681522b78442d2d91ebf24", "ja": "えっ、いきなり何だ？", "zh": "诶，怎么突然说这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "e762575f69ed8e670be68225b4b0a069927305e5976948f0fd02ae24260e7be3", "ja": "だって、こんな素敵なワンピースを\n着られるなんて、嬉しくて……。", "zh": "因为能穿上这么漂亮的连衣裙，我实在太开心了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "40b9eb4a9052bcaf3c66c4c3a8936c948948965aee385f370a2c02b2ad12a107", "ja": "こういうのって、清楚？　爽やか？\nふふっ、なんだかドキドキしますね！", "zh": "这种感觉，是清纯？还是清爽？\n呵呵，总觉得有点心跳加速呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1005_p", "source_sha256": "98eed04c6da5d20287084da2d1c5b57c1549d08ea8028c42394952e4c108f9e4", "ja": "ああ、そういうことか。\nうん、よく似合っててカワイイぞ、春香。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事。\n嗯，很适合你，也很可爱哦，春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "4b9b44efa41133e36cf03ef177846d2f01e6c6e22c44376479ed8c008b4148b9", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　……実は、ちょっと\n別の意味でもドキドキしてますけど……。", "zh": "谢谢您♪……其实，其他方面也让我有点心跳加速……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d423cf7fed7a5b4e8b55936b79bb4b6637cad5575ffd6b9a3d1007f8720fc359", "ja": "ん？　別のドキドキって？", "zh": "嗯？别的紧张是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "c2d556ab5ed02b600d431331be65337f4ccbd25ea060e881dc1c2cb2c9c63ad0", "ja": "今日は屋外での撮影ですよね。もし転んじゃって、\nこの真っ白なワンピースを汚したらって……うう。", "zh": "今天是在户外拍摄吧。要是不小心摔倒，把这条雪白的连衣裙弄脏了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "887941c85af5dc558a13ff22ec9389aca809248dbd70dee64831881648c2b8ef", "ja": "なんだ。そのことなら気にしなくても大丈夫だよ。\n安心して、撮影に臨んでくれ。", "zh": "怎么了。要是担心这个，就不用在意了。\n放心去拍摄吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "84c45cf64ab01ad1194a84457d4ef3c9f2e96843f4bcb73c1c80fca30e4a5a51", "ja": "そっか……着替え、あるんですね！　よかったあ♪\nそれなら、心配な……って、うわあーっ！！", "zh": "这样啊……有替换的衣服啊！太好了♪  \n这样一来，就不用担心了……等等，哇啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6994a3d314a4f44263a30b5f6679bb171823cc540b6793759ddde65484e3ecbb", "ja": "うわっ！　大丈夫か？", "zh": "哇！没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "6f96294889318d02ecef0daab210aa480049e3a921d99432722317a1119664ec", "ja": "はっ！　……とっとっと。\nえへへ♪　見てください！　平気でしたっ！", "zh": "哈！……哎呀呀。\n嘿嘿♪ 请看！没事的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "7be5df5ad29d0f667e9bfb89130ac832292168ad4cf2f0fd0306eecde70c746e", "ja": "ふう、さっそく替えのワンピースが\n役立つところでしたよ。", "zh": "呼，差点就要用上备用连衣裙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dbafd1f7fbafbcec712ac531dc45c1952da93f80e3edeaf41b9aeb2973465b5f", "ja": "え？\nいや、替えの衣装なんかないよ。", "zh": "诶？\n不，根本没有备用服装哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "7725705e4a50362eef7603e05dca364192f401f6c0d256740dbc641635160075", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうなんですか？\nじゃあ、汚しちゃったら、どうすれば……？", "zh": "诶诶！？原、原来是这样吗？\n那要是不小心弄脏了，该怎么办……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1d0f775afd0ce89d9f30f93aa77bd40e633ad88901c90874e34407a03f11a43b", "ja": "いや、春香。料理の時だって、エプロンって\nどうしても汚れてしまうものだろう？", "zh": "不是，春香。做菜的时候，围裙本来也\n难免会弄脏的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "079dce1646d04ed48a97e8d849d26154a8bc4beb826a188fb8046b85141c6063", "ja": "え、それは、そうですけど……。夢中で作ってると、\nいつの間にか汚れちゃったりしますね。", "zh": "诶，这个嘛，确实是这样……专心做菜的时候，不知不觉就会弄脏呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6a7c24f07040443e2b078b77e9e2d0f0910152e8f01c65fec72fbe10a1e97872", "ja": "だけどそれを、料理中に細かく気にしないんじゃ\nないか？　それより大事なのは……。", "zh": "不过，做饭的时候不会一直在意这些细节吧？比起这个，更重要的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "65d01216cd716a28db4c4f209746da86bb10f55eaab0c500233cb1307c9cf426", "ja": "……おいしく、楽しく、心を込めて作ること。\nあ……そうですよね。撮影も、同じかも……。", "zh": "……美味、开心、用心去制作。\n啊……确实呢。拍摄也是同样的道理吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9a8f0324ae4e181a31dad95703a38ef40e6091acacc441e4d45d0d704ae12f91", "ja": "うん。汚れは気にせず、思いっきりやったほうが、\nいい写真が撮れると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。别在意弄脏，尽管放开手脚去做，\n我觉得能拍出更好的照片哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "de36e464432c2106bc68cb404091318654101190b271cf665a3a9281b2c386be", "ja": "はい！　わかりました。\n思いっきり、楽しんで撮影してもらってきますね！", "zh": "好的！我明白了。\n我会尽情享受拍摄，拍出好照片给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3a4f4dcf6204ba330e09d65b688dc74fa6897c38d2f5c954492f40cf9e78d2ad", "ja": "ああ、頼んだぞ春香！　……とは言っても、\n思いっきり転んで、ケガなんかするなよ？", "zh": "啊，拜托你了，春香！……虽然这么说，\n可别摔得太重，弄伤自己啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "af8f6f17bc1cb68de7f8414503fd7ba9195e7847bd98ed25ef382a545a4219dc", "ja": "ふふっ、だいじょうぶですよーだ！\nそれじゃあ、今度こそ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "呵呵，放心吧——！\n那么这次我真的要出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "707568434e9f95e84f7ed5da24b0d5665b1c0b6b06a7ac2c5f97ecc2781179b7", "ja": "うわわわーーーっ………とっとっと！\n………セーフ！　えへへっ！", "zh": "哇哇哇哇——哎……等等等！\n……安全过关！嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0173_1025_p", "source_sha256": "9d9b8ed1b84034928bec7ad72ec4591982c9310ec9c5b48367e1c5895f76eb4d", "ja": "（……いい感じに緊張が解けたみたいだな。\n自然な笑顔で、撮影に臨んでくれそうだ！）", "zh": "（……看来她已经不紧张了。这样应该能带着自然的笑容投入拍摄了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
